{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Battle of Goldfish Scooping&quot;\u00a0</strong>is an asymmetrical multiplayer action game inspired by <i>kingyo-sukui</i>, the classic goldfish scooping game from Japanese fairs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scoop with Delicate Skill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>poi</i>\u2014a fragile paper scoop\u2014to catch goldfish and drop them into the bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop them one after another to trigger combos and earn bonus points!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Goldfish and Escape!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a goldfish and dart through the water to avoid the poi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect glowing orbs to raise your score\u2014and even if you\u2019re scooped up, bounce your way to freedom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Each Time You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new skills and boost your stats based on your results after each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep improving, and aim for the high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Festival Online</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a shared tank with players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014other players might steal your catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A playful twist on a timeless Japanese festival tradition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you scoop\u2014or be scooped?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2987080?t=1762495644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/76566aeb50a879adfa16406f6c5b6d0af08e8e01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762495644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/733e58eef7f5fef205ea129881ce0f5d64a2fbcd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762495644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/733e58eef7f5fef205ea129881ce0f5d64a2fbcd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762495644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Battle of Goldfish Scooping&quot;\u00a0</strong>is an asymmetrical multiplayer action game inspired by <i>kingyo-sukui</i>, the classic goldfish scooping game from Japanese fairs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scoop with Delicate Skill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>poi</i>\u2014a fragile paper scoop\u2014to catch goldfish and drop them into the bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop them one after another to trigger combos and earn bonus points!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Goldfish and Escape!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a goldfish and dart through the water to avoid the poi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect glowing orbs to raise your score\u2014and even if you\u2019re scooped up, bounce your way to freedom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Each Time You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new skills and boost your stats based on your results after each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep improving, and aim for the high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Festival Online</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a shared tank with players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014other players might steal your catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A playful twist on a timeless Japa